(5159075, 751554, 100301, '<td valign="top">I''m 29, and I wouldn''t try to win that fight!  Great capture of of a subject that shows his lifetime in his face.</td>', 'I''m 29, and I wouldn''t try to win that fight!  Great capture of of a subject that shows his lifetime in his face.', '2008-12-31 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
