(5159105, 751316, 100301, '<td valign="top">lighting too harsh, I can see his face in a black and white smoking that pipe on a dimly lit back porch though!</td>', 'lighting too harsh, I can see his face in a black and white smoking that pipe on a dimly lit back porch though!', '2008-12-31 01:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159112, 750712, 100301, '<td valign="top">the title fits the smile</td>', 'the title fits the smile', '2008-12-31 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159233, 751551, 78483, '<td valign="top">it focused on her glasses</td>', 'it focused on her glasses', '2008-12-31 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159367, 749886, 34059, '<td valign="top">I think this one is my favourite of the challenge... quite odd, as it does not show the face as a portrait should tipically do!<br/>But nonetheless the composition, the purple color of her coat, the black stones, the shallow DOF, the perfect height of the sun, all together make this picture a meaningful portrait. Very nicely done!</td>', 'I think this one is my favourite of the challenge... quite odd, as it does not show the face as a portrait should tipically do!But nonetheless the composition, the purple color of her coat, the black stones, the shallow DOF, the perfect height of the sun, all together make this picture a meaningful portrait. Very nicely done!', '2008-12-31 05:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159370, 751194, 34059, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, I like the high key and the not perfeclty centered composition. I only wish the eyes were fully open, as they are looking down I feel I miss the object they are looking at.</td>', 'Very good photo, I like the high key and the not perfeclty centered composition. I only wish the eyes were fully open, as they are looking down I feel I miss the object they are looking at.', '2008-12-31 05:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159372, 751334, 99710, '<td valign="top">i like this pic more than any other else in this challenge but i think you can let go of the borders. your framing is excellent enough that you dont need the borders to enhance the image.</td>', 'i like this pic more than any other else in this challenge but i think you can let go of the borders. your framing is excellent enough that you dont need the borders to enhance the image.', '2008-12-31 05:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159373, 750801, 7473, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.</td>', 'nice portrait.', '2008-12-31 05:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159374, 750455, 99710, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition.</td>', 'beautiful composition.', '2008-12-31 05:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159382, 750873, 34059, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and model! I also like very much the lighting and sharpness. If there''s anything, I am not enthusistic of the composition. Maybe having the subject a bit more on the right, so that you could have some more blank space on the left, would have given some space for her look to go through. Or maybe cropping out the right side of the image, cutting away the earring, would have better drawn the attention on her face. Just my thought. Anyway one of my favourite images of the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice portrait and model! I also like very much the lighting and sharpness. If there''s anything, I am not enthusistic of the composition. Maybe having the subject a bit more on the right, so that you could have some more blank space on the left, would have given some space for her look to go through. Or maybe cropping out the right side of the image, cutting away the earring, would have better drawn the attention on her face. Just my thought. Anyway one of my favourite images of the challenge.', '2008-12-31 05:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159383, 751466, 34059, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this is not very interesting. There is too much brown, the man is not smiling nor thoughtful, the baby does not show his/her eyes, the pose is not dynamic and too much centered (there are not leading lines to give some movement to the composition). I like the idea, though. Maybe a darker background and a different position of the two (as the man holding the baby with both hands and looking into the baby''s eyes) would have helped in making it a more attractive picture.</td>', 'Unfortunately this is not very interesting. There is too much brown, the man is not smiling nor thoughtful, the baby does not show his/her eyes, the pose is not dynamic and too much centered (there are not leading lines to give some movement to the composition). I like the idea, though. Maybe a darker background and a different position of the two (as the man holding the baby with both hands and looking into the baby''s eyes) would have helped in making it a more attractive picture.', '2008-12-31 05:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159388, 750427, 34059, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is not so bad, but maybe it is oversharpened, something in the quality of the image is somehow bothersome for the eyes.</td>', 'I think this picture is not so bad, but maybe it is oversharpened, something in the quality of the image is somehow bothersome for the eyes.', '2008-12-31 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159389, 750848, 34059, '<td valign="top">I think the curtain in the background is distracting and there is something not working with the lighting (the face is too much darker than the hands). Anyway I like the relaxed pose and the peaceful expression.</td>', 'I think the curtain in the background is distracting and there is something not working with the lighting (the face is too much darker than the hands). Anyway I like the relaxed pose and the peaceful expression.', '2008-12-31 05:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159400, 751291, 64568, '<td valign="top">my winner, wonderful emotion, look like the kind of parents/grandparents you would want to know/have...really lovely shot.</td>', 'my winner, wonderful emotion, look like the kind of parents/grandparents you would want to know/have...really lovely shot.', '2008-12-31 05:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
