(5159405, 751305, 99506, '<td valign="top">This has to be my favourite shot in this challenge because not only is it a well executed and interesting shot but you thought outside of the box nice one. 10</td>', 'This has to be my favourite shot in this challenge because not only is it a well executed and interesting shot but you thought outside of the box nice one. 10', '2008-12-31 06:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
