(5159414, 751437, 67363, '<td valign="top">This a lovely character shot. Love it!</td>', 'This a lovely character shot. Love it!', '2008-12-31 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159415, 750168, 99506, '<td valign="top">Loving the title lol</td>', 'Loving the title lol', '2008-12-31 06:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159473, 751335, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh, love the dark shadows. The shadow on his face is a little disctracting.</td>', 'Great bokeh, love the dark shadows. The shadow on his face is a little disctracting.', '2008-12-31 07:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159474, 750893, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great warm light.</td>', 'Great warm light.', '2008-12-31 07:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159475, 750207, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, nice patterned background and composition. I think I''d prefer it if you had take one step closer to get a little closer view of his face. Nicely done!</td>', 'Great expression, nice patterned background and composition. I think I''d prefer it if you had take one step closer to get a little closer view of his face. Nicely done!', '2008-12-31 07:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159476, 751527, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, bokeh, warm light and composition. I love the tight framing on her face. You also did a very nice job avoiding reflections in the glasses. Well done!</td>', 'Great expression, bokeh, warm light and composition. I love the tight framing on her face. You also did a very nice job avoiding reflections in the glasses. Well done!', '2008-12-31 07:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159478, 750168, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and expression! I love this shot! I think I''d like it better with a little less contrast but still a great shot!</td>', 'Great eyes and expression! I love this shot! I think I''d like it better with a little less contrast but still a great shot!', '2008-12-31 07:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159479, 751203, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and fun expressions!</td>', 'Great lighting and fun expressions!', '2008-12-31 07:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159480, 750329, 88204, '<td valign="top">This has great potential. I like his pose and expression. The background is far too bright such that we can''t see his face very well. You might have cropped for less background so your camera could meter more on his face, used a reflector or maybe popped in a tiny bit of fill flash. Great framing and composition had the background not been so bright.</td>', 'This has great potential. I like his pose and expression. The background is far too bright such that we can''t see his face very well. You might have cropped for less background so your camera could meter more on his face, used a reflector or maybe popped in a tiny bit of fill flash. Great framing and composition had the background not been so bright.', '2008-12-31 07:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159481, 751349, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting and their expressions. I think I would have framed them to the left of the frame to get them off center and give more space where they are looking.</td>', 'I like the backlighting and their expressions. I think I would have framed them to the left of the frame to get them off center and give more space where they are looking.', '2008-12-31 07:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159484, 750412, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft lighting. I think I''d like it a little more if she was looking at the camera.</td>', 'Beautiful soft lighting. I think I''d like it a little more if she was looking at the camera.', '2008-12-31 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159485, 750491, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great warm light and expression. Her eyes look warm and kind... reminds me of my Grandma Millie. Given that she''s facing to the right, I think I would have framed her a little more to the left, giving more space in front of her body and less at her back, also getting her face off center. Nice portrait. This definitely captures wisdom, warmth and kindness.</td>', 'Great warm light and expression. Her eyes look warm and kind... reminds me of my Grandma Millie. Given that she''s facing to the right, I think I would have framed her a little more to the left, giving more space in front of her body and less at her back, also getting her face off center. Nice portrait. This definitely captures wisdom, warmth and kindness.', '2008-12-31 07:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159486, 749962, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great experession! Very nice warm, soft light as well. Well done!</td>', 'Great experession! Very nice warm, soft light as well. Well done!', '2008-12-31 07:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159487, 751194, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the high key treatment on this. My personal preference would be for him to be looking at the camera. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the high key treatment on this. My personal preference would be for him to be looking at the camera. Nicely done.', '2008-12-31 07:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159489, 751551, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great soft, warm light. You captured the kindness in her eyes and smile. Eyes aren''t quite sharp enough.</td>', 'Great soft, warm light. You captured the kindness in her eyes and smile. Eyes aren''t quite sharp enough.', '2008-12-31 07:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159491, 750886, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting expresion. I like the close crop, although I would get rid of the dead space above her head. That would get her face off center and bring us closer in to focus on the expression. It would also give you fewer bright spots in the top of the image, which would give more detail in teh shadows of her eyes. I like the B&amp;W/sepia treatment. It keeps us focused on her expression. Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting expresion. I like the close crop, although I would get rid of the dead space above her head. That would get her face off center and bring us closer in to focus on the expression. It would also give you fewer bright spots in the top of the image, which would give more detail in teh shadows of her eyes. I like the B&W/sepia treatment. It keeps us focused on her expression. Nicely done.', '2008-12-31 07:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159496, 750455, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ooh... I love this shot. The setting makes for a great environmental portrait. The light highlights him just right. Black &amp; white is perfect for this. I wish there were a tad more detail in his pants. I also wish he were looking at the camera. My favorite so far!</td>', 'Ooh... I love this shot. The setting makes for a great environmental portrait. The light highlights him just right. Black & white is perfect for this. I wish there were a tad more detail in his pants. I also wish he were looking at the camera. My favorite so far!', '2008-12-31 07:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159498, 749886, 88204, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. You can really get a sense of the emotion she must be feeling. It feels like it could be cropped a little tighter with less space to her left.</td>', 'I really like this shot. You can really get a sense of the emotion she must be feeling. It feels like it could be cropped a little tighter with less space to her left.', '2008-12-31 07:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159500, 750934, 88204, '<td valign="top">He''s in great shape for 80! I like the warm light and the full body composition. The upper sky is a bit grey... not sure what your options were there. Nice warm, soft, side lighting. Well done!</td>', 'He''s in great shape for 80! I like the warm light and the full body composition. The upper sky is a bit grey... not sure what your options were there. Nice warm, soft, side lighting. Well done!', '2008-12-31 07:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159501, 751440, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! I love the close crop, soft side lighting and detail. The sparkle in his left eye adds an interesting dimension... almost loks like a tear. My favorite so far! 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot! I love the close crop, soft side lighting and detail. The sparkle in his left eye adds an interesting dimension... almost loks like a tear. My favorite so far! 10', '2008-12-31 07:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159503, 750427, 88204, '<td valign="top">Good subject and expression. On camera flash is very harsh and flat.</td>', 'Good subject and expression. On camera flash is very harsh and flat.', '2008-12-31 07:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159592, 751420, 19831, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work. This is photography. An instant fav.</td>', 'Outstanding work. This is photography. An instant fav.', '2008-12-31 09:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159600, 751437, 100064, '<td valign="top">When this picture came up there was someone playing a harmonica on the TV. It was funny. Haahaha.</td>', 'When this picture came up there was someone playing a harmonica on the TV. It was funny. Haahaha.', '2008-12-31 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159629, 750492, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very emotive and photojournaistic.  I really like it!</td>', 'This is very emotive and photojournaistic.  I really like it!', '2008-12-31 09:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159633, 750873, 24454, '<td valign="top">Not voting on this one, but I had to comment.  I think this portrait is a standout in this challenge.  She is absolutely radiant, and the technical aspects on this are flawless!  Good Luck!  It should most definitely be in the very top few -- in my opinion.</td>', 'Not voting on this one, but I had to comment.  I think this portrait is a standout in this challenge.  She is absolutely radiant, and the technical aspects on this are flawless!  Good Luck!  It should most definitely be in the very top few -- in my opinion.', '2008-12-31 09:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159637, 751305, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh, nice shot!  I love photos like this.   I have to say my faith in the out-of-the-box mindset of  most dpc voters isn''t very strong, so I hope you aren''t getting punished for this not being a person -- because I think it is very cool art :)</td>', 'Oooooh, nice shot!  I love photos like this.   I have to say my faith in the out-of-the-box mindset of  most dpc voters isn''t very strong, so I hope you aren''t getting punished for this not being a person -- because I think it is very cool art :)', '2008-12-31 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159638, 751089, 24454, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful!   She makes becoming "elderly" look like something not to be feared!  :)</td>', 'She''s beautiful!   She makes becoming "elderly" look like something not to be feared!  :)', '2008-12-31 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159804, 751437, 101702, '<td valign="top">The only photo I rated a 10 in this challenge. Every part of the guy is rich in texture and detail, and it looks great in black and white. Love the position of the guy in the frame, and the crop to the edges of the hat. This has got to be a contender for the number 1 spot :-)</td>', 'The only photo I rated a 10 in this challenge. Every part of the guy is rich in texture and detail, and it looks great in black and white. Love the position of the guy in the frame, and the crop to the edges of the hat. This has got to be a contender for the number 1 spot :-)', '2008-12-31 10:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159868, 751551, 56849, '<td valign="top">"Wisdom", you should have called it "Beauty"</td>', '"Wisdom", you should have called it "Beauty"', '2008-12-31 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159904, 750455, 98339, '<td valign="top">a bit grainy and crooked (but maybe you wanted that?)</td>', 'a bit grainy and crooked (but maybe you wanted that?)', '2008-12-31 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5159906, 751530, 98339, '<td valign="top">don''t see what the Portrait of the Elderly has to do with this?</td>', 'don''t see what the Portrait of the Elderly has to do with this?', '2008-12-31 11:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
