(5159983, 751551, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this photograph, her eyes, the earrings, sweater even the lights in the back...good shot...top pick so far</td>', 'I really like the colors in this photograph, her eyes, the earrings, sweater even the lights in the back...good shot...top pick so far', '2008-12-31 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
