(5160289, 751440, 69325, '<td valign="top">i can''t think of a negative thing to say about this shot, you did a good job on the b&amp;w conversion, which is difficult in basic editing since you can''t spot dodge the eyes. the expression on his face is something between satisfaction and wistfullness. excellent work. /9</td>', 'i can''t think of a negative thing to say about this shot, you did a good job on the b&w conversion, which is difficult in basic editing since you can''t spot dodge the eyes. the expression on his face is something between satisfaction and wistfullness. excellent work. /9', '2008-12-31 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5160290, 751347, 76811, '<td valign="top">Great moment I really like the idea, the softness probably works for most people becasue of the reverence, but I would have liked it to be a little sharper</td>', 'Great moment I really like the idea, the softness probably works for most people becasue of the reverence, but I would have liked it to be a little sharper', '2008-12-31 14:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
