(5162415, 751528, 60047, '<td valign="top">I think this could benefit from a much tighter crop. The hair on the right is a bit distracting. Great capture of his face.</td>', 'I think this could benefit from a much tighter crop. The hair on the right is a bit distracting. Great capture of his face.', '2009-01-01 10:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
