(5162801, 751420, 63503, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but it is not a portrait, so, I''ll take one point out from 8</td>', 'I like this picture but it is not a portrait, so, I''ll take one point out from 8', '2009-01-01 13:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5162943, 751194, 53147, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Detail is wonderful without it feeling overprocessed. Love that he isnt looking at the camera. Has a brilliant caught feel to it but with wonderful studio like technicals.</td>', 'Love this shot. Detail is wonderful without it feeling overprocessed. Love that he isnt looking at the camera. Has a brilliant caught feel to it but with wonderful studio like technicals.', '2009-01-01 13:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5162983, 751194, 67585, '<td valign="top">Very strong Image.  The only one of the challenge that stopped me in my tracks.  Curious to know how this was lit also.  Great job!!  This is blue ribbon material for certain.</td>', 'Very strong Image.  The only one of the challenge that stopped me in my tracks.  Curious to know how this was lit also.  Great job!!  This is blue ribbon material for certain.', '2009-01-01 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5162985, 751437, 67585, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and color treatment. Nice job</td>', 'I like the processing and color treatment. Nice job', '2009-01-01 14:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5162995, 751440, 67585, '<td valign="top">Nice Title.  Nice job with the lighting.</td>', 'Nice Title.  Nice job with the lighting.', '2009-01-01 14:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163062, 751437, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is great capture, I''m bummed by the sharpening artifacts. Probably did not need that much sharpening! Oh well, lovely portrait otherwise.</td>', 'This is great capture, I''m bummed by the sharpening artifacts. Probably did not need that much sharpening! Oh well, lovely portrait otherwise.', '2009-01-01 14:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163111, 751530, 60047, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too far in the BG for this to work for me.</td>', 'Just a bit too far in the BG for this to work for me.', '2009-01-01 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163112, 750009, 60047, '<td valign="top">Truly a contender for a ribbon. The light is managed masterfully. The composition is well done. The DOF is perfect. Color tones work well. The expression is great. You really have a masterpiece, here.</td>', 'Truly a contender for a ribbon. The light is managed masterfully. The composition is well done. The DOF is perfect. Color tones work well. The expression is great. You really have a masterpiece, here.', '2009-01-01 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163113, 751440, 60047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. A top contender IMO.</td>', 'Excellent. A top contender IMO.', '2009-01-01 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163114, 751437, 60047, '<td valign="top">Easily a top contender for this challenge. Great subject. Great technicals.</td>', 'Easily a top contender for this challenge. Great subject. Great technicals.', '2009-01-01 15:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163115, 751194, 60047, '<td valign="top">What a striking high key capture. What a fascinating choice to use a shot where the subject is looking down. You''ve really stepped out of the box with this submission - congrats this is a great entry.</td>', 'What a striking high key capture. What a fascinating choice to use a shot where the subject is looking down. You''ve really stepped out of the box with this submission - congrats this is a great entry.', '2009-01-01 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163116, 749908, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is incredible work for the Basic rule set.</td>', 'This is incredible work for the Basic rule set.', '2009-01-01 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163117, 750168, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great shot. One of the better entries. The contrast seems to be just a bit too much on this one - the skin tones are pretty dark vs the turban being a bit blown out. Masterful use of a great BG. Incredible piercing expression.</td>', 'Great shot. One of the better entries. The contrast seems to be just a bit too much on this one - the skin tones are pretty dark vs the turban being a bit blown out. Masterful use of a great BG. Incredible piercing expression.', '2009-01-01 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163118, 750873, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. I think you could even crop out the right 25% of this shot.</td>', 'This is excellent. I think you could even crop out the right 25% of this shot.', '2009-01-01 15:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163119, 751334, 60047, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this is a style preference, but I would prefer her face to be in focus more than her hair. This is a wonderful close up B &amp; W.</td>', 'Perhaps this is a style preference, but I would prefer her face to be in focus more than her hair. This is a wonderful close up B & W.', '2009-01-01 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163120, 750199, 60047, '<td valign="top">This really captures a wonderful sense that this man marches to the beat of his own drummer. Great capture.</td>', 'This really captures a wonderful sense that this man marches to the beat of his own drummer. Great capture.', '2009-01-01 15:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163122, 751291, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. Love the expressions. I think the faces could have benefited from a little lightening (eg using the "fill light" option in LR or ACR). This technique would have helped you keep from losing the detail in the hair.</td>', 'This is a great capture. Love the expressions. I think the faces could have benefited from a little lightening (eg using the "fill light" option in LR or ACR). This technique would have helped you keep from losing the detail in the hair.', '2009-01-01 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163124, 751203, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is priceless. I love his expression. The fact that the girl is turned away does a great job of keeping the emphasis on him and what he is doing. The tones on him are perfect whereas the light on her appears to be just a hair too light.</td>', 'This is priceless. I love his expression. The fact that the girl is turned away does a great job of keeping the emphasis on him and what he is doing. The tones on him are perfect whereas the light on her appears to be just a hair too light.', '2009-01-01 15:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163125, 750893, 60047, '<td valign="top">With these color tones I get more of a sense of twilight than I do sunshine - which actually works better as a metaphor IMO. Interesting expression.</td>', 'With these color tones I get more of a sense of twilight than I do sunshine - which actually works better as a metaphor IMO. Interesting expression.', '2009-01-01 15:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163126, 751423, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expression. Great composition.</td>', 'Beautiful expression. Great composition.', '2009-01-01 15:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163127, 750934, 60047, '<td valign="top">What a great statement of authority this shot has. I love the POV of the camera. The shadow from his left arm is the only technical distraction in this shot.</td>', 'What a great statement of authority this shot has. I love the POV of the camera. The shadow from his left arm is the only technical distraction in this shot.', '2009-01-01 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163611, 751440, 101117, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W makes this shot much more striking, however I don''t like the way you have cropped it, cutting of part of the left eye. Moving the crop a touch to the right would have helped here.</td>', 'B&W makes this shot much more striking, however I don''t like the way you have cropped it, cutting of part of the left eye. Moving the crop a touch to the right would have helped here.', '2009-01-01 18:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163619, 751336, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice well lit portrait. The white blob to the top left of the background is a little distracting though, you could have cloned that out or burned it slightly to make it less obvious.</td>', 'Nice well lit portrait. The white blob to the top left of the background is a little distracting though, you could have cloned that out or burned it slightly to make it less obvious.', '2009-01-01 18:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163624, 750873, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and a great expression. I think there is a little too much empty space on the right side of the image though, perhaps if you cropped a little of that dark area out on the right it would have been better.</td>', 'Nice portrait and a great expression. I think there is a little too much empty space on the right side of the image though, perhaps if you cropped a little of that dark area out on the right it would have been better.', '2009-01-01 18:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163628, 751420, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, not so sure if you could call it a portrait so much as a candid. I like it however especially the way all three are framed within the arch. 7</td>', 'Interesting shot, not so sure if you could call it a portrait so much as a candid. I like it however especially the way all three are framed within the arch. 7', '2009-01-01 18:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163634, 750620, 101117, '<td valign="top">The portrait here is nice, but the background is a little distracting with the contrast between the curtain and the white wall. There seems to be a little motion blur here as well, a tripod or higher shutter speed would have sorted that out.</td>', 'The portrait here is nice, but the background is a little distracting with the contrast between the curtain and the white wall. There seems to be a little motion blur here as well, a tripod or higher shutter speed would have sorted that out.', '2009-01-01 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163636, 751128, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the way you have kept most of the left side of the face in shadow while still maintaining detail in the eye.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the way you have kept most of the left side of the face in shadow while still maintaining detail in the eye.', '2009-01-01 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163645, 750934, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the use of location and golf club to add to the shot. I like the angle as well, makes him look more imposing which compliments the proud look.</td>', 'Great shot, love the use of location and golf club to add to the shot. I like the angle as well, makes him look more imposing which compliments the proud look.', '2009-01-01 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163647, 750427, 101117, '<td valign="top">The harsh front on lighting hasn''t helped here. It''s caused parts of the face to become very bright and left a distracting shadow on the background.</td>', 'The harsh front on lighting hasn''t helped here. It''s caused parts of the face to become very bright and left a distracting shadow on the background.', '2009-01-01 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163655, 751334, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and interesting angle. Portraits should tend to focus on the eye area though, and it seems you have just missed that and focused more on the cheek. This will always tend to happen with autofocus, which I''m guessing is the case here. It''s a good idea to try a few shots using manual focus when doing portraits with this sort of DOF.</td>', 'Nice portrait and interesting angle. Portraits should tend to focus on the eye area though, and it seems you have just missed that and focused more on the cheek. This will always tend to happen with autofocus, which I''m guessing is the case here. It''s a good idea to try a few shots using manual focus when doing portraits with this sort of DOF.', '2009-01-01 18:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163661, 751335, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, like the background as well here. It looks like there is a light shining through the glass though casting the shadow on his face, would have been nice if you could have avoided that as it takes away from the shot a bit.</td>', 'Nice portrait, like the background as well here. It looks like there is a light shining through the glass though casting the shadow on his face, would have been nice if you could have avoided that as it takes away from the shot a bit.', '2009-01-01 18:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163663, 751423, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great portrait with a very nice expression.</td>', 'Great portrait with a very nice expression.', '2009-01-01 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163669, 751194, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking portrait, which I think is helped along by the very good use of lighting. One of the better shots in this challenge. 9</td>', 'This is a very striking portrait, which I think is helped along by the very good use of lighting. One of the better shots in this challenge. 9', '2009-01-01 18:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163673, 751448, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, good choice of background as well.</td>', 'Nice portrait, good choice of background as well.', '2009-01-01 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163682, 751437, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I think B&amp;W works well here.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I think B&W works well here.', '2009-01-01 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163700, 750758, 101117, '<td valign="top">The cropping here feels a little tight at the bottom. I think opening this out a little would have helped.</td>', 'The cropping here feels a little tight at the bottom. I think opening this out a little would have helped.', '2009-01-01 18:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163702, 750491, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with good light. This shot does give a feeling of warmth!</td>', 'Nice portrait with good light. This shot does give a feeling of warmth!', '2009-01-01 18:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163710, 750305, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark, and the light on the glasses makes them grab my attention. I think a little fill lighting from the general direction of the camera would have helped.</td>', 'This is a little dark, and the light on the glasses makes them grab my attention. I think a little fill lighting from the general direction of the camera would have helped.', '2009-01-01 18:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163726, 750105, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot with nice lighting. I like the way you have been able to balance the strong light from the right and still keep good exposure.</td>', 'Great shot with nice lighting. I like the way you have been able to balance the strong light from the right and still keep good exposure.', '2009-01-01 18:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163733, 749886, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed powerful shot. I am drawn to the lady straight away, but then I find myself looking over the whole area of the shot and thinking about it. 8</td>', 'This is a well composed powerful shot. I am drawn to the lady straight away, but then I find myself looking over the whole area of the shot and thinking about it. 8', '2009-01-01 18:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163736, 751086, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well lit shot.</td>', 'Nicely composed and well lit shot.', '2009-01-01 18:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163737, 750801, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good well lit shot, but when I first looked at it I felt as though there was a sad look there, which contrasts with what you have for the topic. Still, good shot all the same. 7</td>', 'Good well lit shot, but when I first looked at it I felt as though there was a sad look there, which contrasts with what you have for the topic. Still, good shot all the same. 7', '2009-01-01 18:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163738, 751291, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and good use of b&amp;w to highlight the details and textures. Skin tones seem a touch dark though, as though you applied a blue filter or some similar effect. Like it a lot though, 7.</td>', 'Great shot, and good use of b&w to highlight the details and textures. Skin tones seem a touch dark though, as though you applied a blue filter or some similar effect. Like it a lot though, 7.', '2009-01-01 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163752, 749883, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but there are 2 things which I feel could have improved it. The first is that the frames of the glasses are partially covering the eyes, and from what I can see, there is an interesting expression there so it makes me want to see the eyes better.  The second is that there seems to be a slight blur, perhaps motion blur in the shot, probably a result of the shutter speed being too slow.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but there are 2 things which I feel could have improved it. The first is that the frames of the glasses are partially covering the eyes, and from what I can see, there is an interesting expression there so it makes me want to see the eyes better.  The second is that there seems to be a slight blur, perhaps motion blur in the shot, probably a result of the shutter speed being too slow.', '2009-01-01 18:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163757, 751165, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the contrast of the brightly coloured top and the black background work too well here. The portrait itself is nice, but the black background is actually distracting because of its harsh contrast with the lady.</td>', 'I don''t think the contrast of the brightly coloured top and the black background work too well here. The portrait itself is nice, but the black background is actually distracting because of its harsh contrast with the lady.', '2009-01-01 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163861, 751551, 327, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful. Such wonderful blue eyes. Lovely. You did a good job capturing her.</td>', 'She''s beautiful. Such wonderful blue eyes. Lovely. You did a good job capturing her.', '2009-01-01 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163866, 751285, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2009-01-01 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163872, 751336, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job on the lighting, well done.</td>', 'Wonderful job on the lighting, well done.', '2009-01-01 19:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163875, 750532, 327, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with you shot but the composition could of been a bit better. the light by the window was good.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with you shot but the composition could of been a bit better. the light by the window was good.', '2009-01-01 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163876, 749883, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a bit off on the focus but I like her pose.</td>', 'Just a bit off on the focus but I like her pose.', '2009-01-01 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163879, 751589, 327, '<td valign="top">She looks very young for her age. Bad shiner and she''s still lovely.</td>', 'She looks very young for her age. Bad shiner and she''s still lovely.', '2009-01-01 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163883, 750848, 327, '<td valign="top">Handsome man even with the bangs and bumps. Hope he''s better soon.</td>', 'Handsome man even with the bangs and bumps. Hope he''s better soon.', '2009-01-01 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163888, 751089, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and too young for this challenge. Really she''s very lovely and very young looking. Maybe a bit more focus on the face was needed.</td>', 'Beautiful and too young for this challenge. Really she''s very lovely and very young looking. Maybe a bit more focus on the face was needed.', '2009-01-01 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164006, 750317, 78132, '<td valign="top">He looks like such a kind man....</td>', 'He looks like such a kind man....', '2009-01-01 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164031, 750801, 92403, '<td valign="top">this has to be the best color portrait in this challenge. I bet you''ll be a winner... let''s hope I''m right!</td>', 'this has to be the best color portrait in this challenge. I bet you''ll be a winner... let''s hope I''m right!', '2009-01-01 20:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164035, 751440, 92403, '<td valign="top">it''s all about the eyes, isn''t it? for me, a 10!<br/>great job.</td>', 'it''s all about the eyes, isn''t it? for me, a 10!great job.', '2009-01-01 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164047, 751305, 92403, '<td valign="top">it is a portrait of something old... as far as this challenge goes, the best in original subject in my opinion. <br/>like that it''s not a centered composition.</td>', 'it is a portrait of something old... as far as this challenge goes, the best in original subject in my opinion. like that it''s not a centered composition.', '2009-01-01 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164099, 751334, 94815, '<td valign="top">Incredible subject for the topic and nice bw renderint. Faces are so important that in a portrait where the eyes are visible in the image, the focus needs to be there instead of the hand. Had the face been averted, the hand would indeed tell a compelling story, but that eye cannot be neglected.</td>', 'Incredible subject for the topic and nice bw renderint. Faces are so important that in a portrait where the eyes are visible in the image, the focus needs to be there instead of the hand. Had the face been averted, the hand would indeed tell a compelling story, but that eye cannot be neglected.', '2009-01-01 21:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164133, 750207, 15711, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.</td>', 'This made me smile.', '2009-01-01 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164135, 750491, 15711, '<td valign="top">She has such a kindness.  I like the use of natural light.</td>', 'She has such a kindness.  I like the use of natural light.', '2009-01-01 21:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164137, 751086, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful face.</td>', 'What a wonderful face.', '2009-01-01 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164139, 751503, 15711, '<td valign="top">Look at the twinkle in those eyes. :~)</td>', 'Look at the twinkle in those eyes. :~)', '2009-01-01 21:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164142, 751551, 15711, '<td valign="top">Look at those beautiful blue eyes!!!</td>', 'Look at those beautiful blue eyes!!!', '2009-01-01 21:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164143, 751291, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a delightful pair.</td>', 'What a delightful pair.', '2009-01-01 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164438, 751440, 98022, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail. Excellent lighting. 9 :)</td>', 'Great focus and detail. Excellent lighting. 9 :)', '2009-01-02 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164557, 751420, 102212, '<td valign="top">I think that one of my favorite things about this photograph is although there are three different men in it, each one seems so isolated from the others. With each of their heads down, it seems to add to how old they already look.</td>', 'I think that one of my favorite things about this photograph is although there are three different men in it, each one seems so isolated from the others. With each of their heads down, it seems to add to how old they already look.', '2009-01-02 03:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164567, 751194, 101822, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly well executed emotional photo. The brightness sets it apart.</td>', 'This is an amazingly well executed emotional photo. The brightness sets it apart.', '2009-01-02 04:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164571, 750491, 101822, '<td valign="top">Her small smile and kind eyes are very beautiful - my only complaint is that the background could improve by being all light or all dark instead of dark on one side, light on another.</td>', 'Her small smile and kind eyes are very beautiful - my only complaint is that the background could improve by being all light or all dark instead of dark on one side, light on another.', '2009-01-02 04:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164574, 751440, 101822, '<td valign="top">Extremely powerful detail and lighting. This photo carries a lot of emotion, especially in the eyes.</td>', 'Extremely powerful detail and lighting. This photo carries a lot of emotion, especially in the eyes.', '2009-01-02 04:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164578, 751291, 101822, '<td valign="top">Gosh darn it, this one puts a huge grin on my face ! If it''s candid, great capture, and if posed, it seems so natural !</td>', 'Gosh darn it, this one puts a huge grin on my face ! If it''s candid, great capture, and if posed, it seems so natural !', '2009-01-02 04:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164633, 750912, 67324, '<td valign="top">These people are not elderly(or look too young). However it does capture the ''Grumps''.</td>', 'These people are not elderly(or look too young). However it does capture the ''Grumps''.', '2009-01-02 05:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164634, 750108, 67324, '<td valign="top">A cluttered frame but personal. The subject is nice and sharp.</td>', 'A cluttered frame but personal. The subject is nice and sharp.', '2009-01-02 06:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164638, 751223, 67324, '<td valign="top">Quite overexposed but lovely subjects. The chair arm cutting through granddads(?) head and shoulder is a tiny bit distracting.</td>', 'Quite overexposed but lovely subjects. The chair arm cutting through granddads(?) head and shoulder is a tiny bit distracting.', '2009-01-02 06:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164643, 750427, 67324, '<td valign="top">This suffers from too-much sharpening.</td>', 'This suffers from too-much sharpening.', '2009-01-02 06:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164647, 751285, 67324, '<td valign="top">Yay, an old person with spunk! Nice composition. I can see you in the reflection. 6</td>', 'Yay, an old person with spunk! Nice composition. I can see you in the reflection. 6', '2009-01-02 06:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164648, 751554, 67324, '<td valign="top">Dudes got ''tude. Cropped too tightly perhaps?</td>', 'Dudes got ''tude. Cropped too tightly perhaps?', '2009-01-02 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164836, 750455, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish this were leveled up ... it makes me a bit disoriented.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I really like it all. 7</td>', 'I wish this were leveled up ... it makes me a bit disoriented. Other than that, I really like it all. 7', '2009-01-02 10:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164852, 751381, 12033, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!</td>', 'LOVE IT!', '2009-01-02 10:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165279, 749908, 2764, '<td valign="top">I so want this one to win!</td>', 'I so want this one to win!', '2009-01-02 14:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165280, 750105, 2764, '<td valign="top">I love how she is surrounded by the simple thing of her life.</td>', 'I love how she is surrounded by the simple thing of her life.', '2009-01-02 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165281, 750529, 2764, '<td valign="top">All those bars make her look imprisoned.  Perhaps she is.</td>', 'All those bars make her look imprisoned.  Perhaps she is.', '2009-01-02 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5165282, 751539, 2764, '<td valign="top">I shouldnt be voting on this computer (worK) - it looks like the white balance is odd on this lovely lady -</td>', 'I shouldnt be voting on this computer (worK) - it looks like the white balance is odd on this lovely lady -', '2009-01-02 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165321, 751437, 61961, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my challenge favorites, perhaps top pick.  Good tones, clarity, and composition.</td>', 'Definitely one of my challenge favorites, perhaps top pick.  Good tones, clarity, and composition.', '2009-01-02 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165322, 750934, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good to see a full-body, environmental portrait.  A well-done character shot.</td>', 'Good to see a full-body, environmental portrait.  A well-done character shot.', '2009-01-02 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165323, 750455, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good environmental portrait.  I think the b&amp;w works well.</td>', 'Good environmental portrait.  I think the b&w works well.', '2009-01-02 14:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165325, 751412, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very cute -- this could have come off like a snapshot, but somehow this is more than the sum of its parts.</td>', 'Very cute -- this could have come off like a snapshot, but somehow this is more than the sum of its parts.', '2009-01-02 14:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165329, 751448, 61961, '<td valign="top">What a nice looking couple.  I could easily see this framed on their piano.  I sort of want to move the camera down a bit and catch a bit more of their torsos.</td>', 'What a nice looking couple.  I could easily see this framed on their piano.  I sort of want to move the camera down a bit and catch a bit more of their torsos.', '2009-01-02 14:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165529, 750168, 36382, '<td valign="top">It''s a great picture, but, honestly, he doesn''t look that old to me.</td>', 'It''s a great picture, but, honestly, he doesn''t look that old to me.', '2009-01-02 15:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165615, 751308, 97225, '<td valign="top">From the thumb I thought she was proudly displaying a real baby. This puts a different slant on it altogether, doesn''t it? It is a nice portrait. I like the eyes - make me wonder what her thoughts are.</td>', 'From the thumb I thought she was proudly displaying a real baby. This puts a different slant on it altogether, doesn''t it? It is a nice portrait. I like the eyes - make me wonder what her thoughts are.', '2009-01-02 16:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165628, 751589, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Nice lighting. She sure has a beauty of a shiner. I know that at that age it often doesn''t take much to bruise like that, so I''m hoping she didn''t suffer too much of an accident.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Nice lighting. She sure has a beauty of a shiner. I know that at that age it often doesn''t take much to bruise like that, so I''m hoping she didn''t suffer too much of an accident.', '2009-01-02 16:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165629, 751539, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like that her face fills the frame.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like that her face fills the frame.', '2009-01-02 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165631, 751437, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. It shows something of his character.</td>', 'Nice portrait. It shows something of his character.', '2009-01-02 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165635, 750886, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light to emphasize her pure white hair.</td>', 'I like the use of light to emphasize her pure white hair.', '2009-01-02 16:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165638, 750893, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I like the soft warm light.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I like the soft warm light.', '2009-01-02 16:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165641, 750912, 97225, '<td valign="top">Don''t look happy, do they? It is a good shot.</td>', 'Don''t look happy, do they? It is a good shot.', '2009-01-02 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165643, 749962, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a lovely happy portrait. 9</td>', 'What a lovely happy portrait. 9', '2009-01-02 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165647, 751165, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like your composition and the dark bg supports it well. Compliments to your mother and her choice of dress. 9</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like your composition and the dark bg supports it well. Compliments to your mother and her choice of dress. 9', '2009-01-02 16:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165651, 749886, 97225, '<td valign="top">So sad that the elderly have to face the loss of their loves. This is a very evocative photo.</td>', 'So sad that the elderly have to face the loss of their loves. This is a very evocative photo.', '2009-01-02 16:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165652, 751415, 97225, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile. He looks such a character, and a charmer. 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-07 01:00:49.</i></td>', 'This makes me smile. He looks such a character, and a charmer. 9', '2009-01-02 16:32:06.000000', '2009-01-07 01:00:49.000000', 1),
(5165654, 751349, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. It conjures up images of what they might be watching, too.</td>', 'Lovely shot. It conjures up images of what they might be watching, too.', '2009-01-02 16:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165656, 750491, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. The light is great.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. The light is great.', '2009-01-02 16:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
