(5165687, 751090, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice happy shot. You have done well to do this self portrait because it doesn''t look posed. 9</td>', 'Nice happy shot. You have done well to do this self portrait because it doesn''t look posed. 9', '2009-01-02 16:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
