(5168295, 751415, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression on an interesting subject! The background adds to it by showing his natural environment. It would have been ideal if you could have brightened up his eyes slightly with reflector. Focus is a bit soft. Well done.</td>', 'Great expression on an interesting subject! The background adds to it by showing his natural environment. It would have been ideal if you could have brightened up his eyes slightly with reflector. Focus is a bit soft. Well done.', '2009-01-03 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
