(5172008, 750108, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the one for me ... Best in Challenge.  For the simple reason that it is <i>about</i> being elderly, and not just a sentimental picture of an elderly person.  Surrounded by family photographs, but alone.  Sustained by a bewildering arsenal of drugs.  Too much furniture in too small a space.  Too many mementos, but each too precious to throw away (or even to <i>put</i> away, in the hope that the person involved might call by).  Warmed by an embroidered granny blanket on a solo chair.  So much of life; so little left.  Plus she''s lovely ... once pretty, still elegant and serene, and still who she was.  And so I must award you the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is the one for me ... Best in Challenge.  For the simple reason that it is about being elderly, and not just a sentimental picture of an elderly person.  Surrounded by family photographs, but alone.  Sustained by a bewildering arsenal of drugs.  Too much furniture in too small a space.  Too many mementos, but each too precious to throw away (or even to put away, in the hope that the person involved might call by).  Warmed by an embroidered granny blanket on a solo chair.  So much of life; so little left.  Plus she''s lovely ... once pretty, still elegant and serene, and still who she was.  And so I must award you the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-01-05 03:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173223, 751527, 72068, '<td valign="top">Not too keen on the yellow border, but a nice picture.</td>', 'Not too keen on the yellow border, but a nice picture.', '2009-01-05 17:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173281, 750305, 46832, '<td valign="top">Interesting model, good composition, bad lighting.</td>', 'Interesting model, good composition, bad lighting.', '2009-01-05 18:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173284, 750207, 46832, '<td valign="top">Bigger please...</td>', 'Bigger please...', '2009-01-05 18:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173285, 751305, 46832, '<td valign="top">Old but not a portrait of the elderly...</td>', 'Old but not a portrait of the elderly...', '2009-01-05 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173291, 751448, 46832, '<td valign="top">A little fill lighting would make it a great photo.</td>', 'A little fill lighting would make it a great photo.', '2009-01-05 18:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173947, 751437, 14437, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The lighting is perfect and the tone is beautiful. Great composition and detail. 9</td>', 'I really like this shot. The lighting is perfect and the tone is beautiful. Great composition and detail. 9', '2009-01-05 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173949, 751440, 14437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and composition. Good focus to reveal the detail around the eyes. I''d have given you a higher score if the DOF is wider to have the lips in focus too. 8</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and composition. Good focus to reveal the detail around the eyes. I''d have given you a higher score if the DOF is wider to have the lips in focus too. 8', '2009-01-05 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173953, 750168, 14437, '<td valign="top">I like the eye contact and the composition. Very good detail too. The blown highlight is a little distracting though. 7</td>', 'I like the eye contact and the composition. Very good detail too. The blown highlight is a little distracting though. 7', '2009-01-05 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173960, 750009, 14437, '<td valign="top">Very good detail. I wonder if you have considered making this submission B&amp;W as I can see a lot of texture around his face which could be revealed more in B&amp;W. Color version is just too distracting, especially the OOF human face on the right, in the back ground. 7</td>', 'Very good detail. I wonder if you have considered making this submission B&W as I can see a lot of texture around his face which could be revealed more in B&W. Color version is just too distracting, especially the OOF human face on the right, in the back ground. 7', '2009-01-05 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174317, 751423, 56167, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful looking lady for her age, I dont mean old people should look bad, I just mean she doesnt look in her ninety''s</td>', 'what a wonderful looking lady for her age, I dont mean old people should look bad, I just mean she doesnt look in her ninety''s', '2009-01-06 07:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174330, 751291, 56167, '<td valign="top">what a happy looking couple, like the black and white image, and the natural look.</td>', 'what a happy looking couple, like the black and white image, and the natural look.', '2009-01-06 08:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174653, 751554, 56502, '<td valign="top">Fitting title - nice.</td>', 'Fitting title - nice.', '2009-01-06 11:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174657, 750455, 56502, '<td valign="top">For me it''s slightly too dark, loosing detail in the shadows, but I really like how you included the environment in the shot.</td>', 'For me it''s slightly too dark, loosing detail in the shadows, but I really like how you included the environment in the shot.', '2009-01-06 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174863, 751437, 63812, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait</td>', 'beautiful portrait', '2009-01-06 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175014, 750491, 52549, '<td valign="top">She looks like a very nice lady.</td>', 'She looks like a very nice lady.', '2009-01-06 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175024, 751125, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is probably a very important image for you to have but I keep wondering if he would have wanted the photo of him dying to be in a challenge. Sorry if I''m being too narrow-minded... seeing him lying there helpless makes me so sad...</td>', 'This is probably a very important image for you to have but I keep wondering if he would have wanted the photo of him dying to be in a challenge. Sorry if I''m being too narrow-minded... seeing him lying there helpless makes me so sad...', '2009-01-06 14:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175026, 751335, 52549, '<td valign="top">He''s "elderly"? Great shot of a handsome man.</td>', 'He''s "elderly"? Great shot of a handsome man.', '2009-01-06 14:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175096, 751429, 78132, '<td valign="top">amazing how young they look!</td>', 'amazing how young they look!', '2009-01-06 15:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175104, 750013, 78132, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but not fitting for this challenge....</td>', 'Great picture, but not fitting for this challenge....', '2009-01-06 15:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175105, 751305, 78132, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but not fitting for this challenge....</td>', 'Great picture, but not fitting for this challenge....', '2009-01-06 15:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175152, 750305, 96915, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems flat.  Compositionally, I''d like to see more space in the direction he''s looking, and less space on the left side of the image.</td>', 'The lighting seems flat.  Compositionally, I''d like to see more space in the direction he''s looking, and less space on the left side of the image.', '2009-01-06 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175154, 751448, 96915, '<td valign="top">I''d suggest a larger aperture to help blur out some of the background.</td>', 'I''d suggest a larger aperture to help blur out some of the background.', '2009-01-06 15:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175156, 751349, 96915, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions.  You have captured pride.  I think I might prefer this with a different crop, leaving less space on the left side of the image and more space in the direction they are looking.</td>', 'I love the expressions.  You have captured pride.  I think I might prefer this with a different crop, leaving less space on the left side of the image and more space in the direction they are looking.', '2009-01-06 15:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175158, 751495, 96924, '<td valign="top">Flash is a bit hard. Maybe if she wqas a bit further from the backdrop you would not have had the shadows on it.</td>', 'Flash is a bit hard. Maybe if she wqas a bit further from the backdrop you would not have had the shadows on it.', '2009-01-06 15:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175165, 750455, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo. The skewness of the fireplace is a bit distracting to me. It is not skew enough to look intentional. It looks unintentional. Either have it SKEW or have it straight. <br/> <br/>Still a good photo. The light on Grand pa is great!</td>', 'This is a very good photo. The skewness of the fireplace is a bit distracting to me. It is not skew enough to look intentional. It looks unintentional. Either have it SKEW or have it straight.  Still a good photo. The light on Grand pa is great!', '2009-01-06 16:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175175, 750199, 96924, '<td valign="top">Your take of the face and eyes are great. It would have been better without the sunglasses.</td>', 'Your take of the face and eyes are great. It would have been better without the sunglasses.', '2009-01-06 16:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175180, 750013, 96924, '<td valign="top">I do not see the portrait in this!</td>', 'I do not see the portrait in this!', '2009-01-06 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175181, 751305, 96924, '<td valign="top">This maybe clever, but it is really not in the spirit of the challenge. There is no portrait here.</td>', 'This maybe clever, but it is really not in the spirit of the challenge. There is no portrait here.', '2009-01-06 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175183, 751530, 96924, '<td valign="top">I really do not see a portrait of the elderly here.</td>', 'I really do not see a portrait of the elderly here.', '2009-01-06 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175185, 750427, 96924, '<td valign="top">The light on the face is good, but the shadow on the backdrop is poor. It gives this a snapshot feel that it does not deserve.</td>', 'The light on the face is good, but the shadow on the backdrop is poor. It gives this a snapshot feel that it does not deserve.', '2009-01-06 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175190, 750106, 96924, '<td valign="top">The glasses seem more in focus than the face. That makes it a picture of the glasses - like in an ad. I like the soft focus on the face though. But then the glasses should have been out of focus as well.</td>', 'The glasses seem more in focus than the face. That makes it a picture of the glasses - like in an ad. I like the soft focus on the face though. But then the glasses should have been out of focus as well.', '2009-01-06 16:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175197, 751429, 96924, '<td valign="top">This was a great moment to photograph, but the flash is a bit harsh here. A softer flash would have given it a "moodier" feel. Now it is closer to a snapshot feel.</td>', 'This was a great moment to photograph, but the flash is a bit harsh here. A softer flash would have given it a "moodier" feel. Now it is closer to a snapshot feel.', '2009-01-06 16:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
