(5176938, 750873, 30982, '<td valign="top">Splendid.  And she does not look "elderly" enough to meet the challenge at all.  :-)  Huge congrats on the new personal best!  And best of all, you have a GREAT picture of your mom - excellent work.</td>', 'Splendid.  And she does not look "elderly" enough to meet the challenge at all.  :-)  Huge congrats on the new personal best!  And best of all, you have a GREAT picture of your mom - excellent work.', '2009-01-07 04:35:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5176971, 751437, 88247, '<td valign="top">Well done Sandy.<br/>A great start to the New Year:-)and what a lovely story and memories!! <br/>Hope you manage to catch up again with Lite Earl Gossage,he deserves another cheeseburger:-)</td>', 'Well done Sandy.A great start to the New Year:-)and what a lovely story and memories!! Hope you manage to catch up again with Lite Earl Gossage,he deserves another cheeseburger:-)', '2009-01-07 04:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177023, 750105, 27346, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments and tips  I would just take them with me for being a first timer in a DSLR world...</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments and tips  I would just take them with me for being a first timer in a DSLR world...', '2009-01-07 05:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177029, 750168, 52549, '<td valign="top">He has a very expressive face and it''s a wonderful portrait. Congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Vikram.</td>', 'He has a very expressive face and it''s a wonderful portrait. Congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Vikram.', '2009-01-07 05:21:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177036, 750168, 99311, '<td valign="top">Hi Vikram... great picture again! Congratulations on your ribbon too ! If you had a Canon 1D I wonder what you would have done :)</td>', 'Hi Vikram... great picture again! Congratulations on your ribbon too ! If you had a Canon 1D I wonder what you would have done :)', '2009-01-07 05:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177043, 751440, 52549, '<td valign="top">Having half his face in the darkness enhances the image for me. I love the sliver of light caused by the tear fluid in his eye. Congrats, Enzo! Great shot and your Dad''s very photogenic.</td>', 'Having half his face in the darkness enhances the image for me. I love the sliver of light caused by the tear fluid in his eye. Congrats, Enzo! Great shot and your Dad''s very photogenic.', '2009-01-07 05:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177051, 751437, 11920, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2009-01-07 05:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177077, 751539, 70661, '<td valign="top">Lots of love for you in those eyes! I''m glad you got to take this great portrait of your grandma, Kelli.</td>', 'Lots of love for you in those eyes! I''m glad you got to take this great portrait of your grandma, Kelli.', '2009-01-07 05:44:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177102, 751437, 70661, '<td valign="top">Awesome Sandy! Congrats!!</td>', 'Awesome Sandy! Congrats!!', '2009-01-07 06:01:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177119, 751305, 101117, '<td valign="top">Such a shame this ranked so low, I can''t believe you suffered so much from DNMC which it so obviously did!</td>', 'Such a shame this ranked so low, I can''t believe you suffered so much from DNMC which it so obviously did!', '2009-01-07 06:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177120, 751305, 102126, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe the comments on lack of relevance for the challenge - it''s a brilliant take on the theme (an obvious one too, unlike some very obscure free associations that seem to take place here) and a fantastic shot. That old car has got bags of personality; congratulations for capturing it so well!</td>', 'I can''t believe the comments on lack of relevance for the challenge - it''s a brilliant take on the theme (an obvious one too, unlike some very obscure free associations that seem to take place here) and a fantastic shot. That old car has got bags of personality; congratulations for capturing it so well!', '2009-01-07 06:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177125, 751437, 20608, '<td valign="top">WOW look at you Sandy..... what a marvelous portrait, I am not surprised to see this in the blue ribbon slot, many congrats.</td>', 'WOW look at you Sandy..... what a marvelous portrait, I am not surprised to see this in the blue ribbon slot, many congrats.', '2009-01-07 06:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177158, 751440, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hey Enzo, good to meet Dad, congrats</td>', 'Hey Enzo, good to meet Dad, congrats', '2009-01-07 06:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177171, 751437, 57882, '<td valign="top">Mad props - Sandy!  Well done, blue ribbon or not.</td>', 'Mad props - Sandy!  Well done, blue ribbon or not.', '2009-01-07 06:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177200, 751437, 88204, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy! Amazing shot and a great story to go with it. You have a talent for street shots! Keep them coming!</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy! Amazing shot and a great story to go with it. You have a talent for street shots! Keep them coming!', '2009-01-07 06:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177217, 751440, 77192, '<td valign="top">Congrats Enzo! I had no idea this was yours.<br/> <br/>I gave you a 10 and a fave - it was either that or a DNMC as your Dad looks far too young for this challenge ;-)<br/> <br/>The details are magnificent, particularly around the right eye (his right not ours) I''m amazed you got such a detailed shot with no noise to speak of at ISO 1600. Great sensor you have!<br/> <br/>The only thing I''d have suggested is a teeny bit less cropped off our right, just enought for his entire eye to be visible.</td>', 'Congrats Enzo! I had no idea this was yours. I gave you a 10 and a fave - it was either that or a DNMC as your Dad looks far too young for this challenge ;-) The details are magnificent, particularly around the right eye (his right not ours) I''m amazed you got such a detailed shot with no noise to speak of at ISO 1600. Great sensor you have! The only thing I''d have suggested is a teeny bit less cropped off our right, just enought for his entire eye to be visible.', '2009-01-07 07:15:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177228, 751437, 61222, '<td valign="top">Congrats Sandy on your Blue Ribbon. I love that shot. <br/></td>', 'Congrats Sandy on your Blue Ribbon. I love that shot. ', '2009-01-07 07:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177238, 750168, 70661, '<td valign="top">What a great capture! Congrats!</td>', 'What a great capture! Congrats!', '2009-01-07 07:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177240, 751440, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats Enzo! Love this!</td>', 'Congrats Enzo! Love this!', '2009-01-07 07:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177270, 751437, 97893, '<td valign="top">Sandy, your picture is amazingly wonderful, and your story ''moving''. Technically it is a good as one can get, and emotively straight-and-transparent (I use this term often, for lack of vocabulary, to describe the pictures to which I am able to connect with ease). <br/> <br/>One day, I am going to invite you to India, and let you loose on the streets. I am sure you will love it. Also, you are going to be one popular person here. :-))).<br/> <br/>Congrats once again, and Good Day!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sandy, your picture is amazingly wonderful, and your story ''moving''. Technically it is a good as one can get, and emotively straight-and-transparent (I use this term often, for lack of vocabulary, to describe the pictures to which I am able to connect with ease).  One day, I am going to invite you to India, and let you loose on the streets. I am sure you will love it. Also, you are going to be one popular person here. :-))). Congrats once again, and Good Day! Regards,Vikram ', '2009-01-07 07:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177273, 751440, 97893, '<td valign="top">Enzo (I find your name very fascinating and unique), apart from the fact that it is very creatively composed, your picture is a in a very personal space and that is what makes it so special and wonderful. Now that I have taken to photography, in some way, I too wish (and plan) to sit with my dad some day and take a lot of his pictures (he used to take a lot of ours when we were kids). He lives some 3000km away, and we get to meet only twice a year, nowadays. On technical front, I am amazed that you managed it so well at ISO 1600. <br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!<br/>:-), Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'Enzo (I find your name very fascinating and unique), apart from the fact that it is very creatively composed, your picture is a in a very personal space and that is what makes it so special and wonderful. Now that I have taken to photography, in some way, I too wish (and plan) to sit with my dad some day and take a lot of his pictures (he used to take a lot of ours when we were kids). He lives some 3000km away, and we get to meet only twice a year, nowadays. On technical front, I am amazed that you managed it so well at ISO 1600.  Congrats on the ribbon!:-), Vikram ', '2009-01-07 08:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177276, 751437, 2240, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy, you hit the nail on the head with this one.</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy, you hit the nail on the head with this one.', '2009-01-07 08:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177280, 750009, 97893, '<td valign="top">This is superb picture. I feel it is better than mine.I am also pleasantly surprised that you took it with 60mm macro. I have imagined in my day-dreaming, what it would mean if I would take pictures with 60mm lens. It is perfect portrait focal length on APSC-format (450, 40, 50D).<br/> <br/>Congrats on the 4th place.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/>P.S. I am just wondering how it would look in B+W. It should be wonderful!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-07 08:26:16.</i></td>', 'This is superb picture. I feel it is better than mine.I am also pleasantly surprised that you took it with 60mm macro. I have imagined in my day-dreaming, what it would mean if I would take pictures with 60mm lens. It is perfect portrait focal length on APSC-format (450, 40, 50D). Congrats on the 4th place. Regards,Vikram P.S. I am just wondering how it would look in B+W. It should be wonderful!', '2009-01-07 08:08:45.000000', '2009-01-07 08:26:16.000000', 0),
(5177281, 751437, 64670, '<td valign="top">Congratulation beautiful one.<br/> <br/>You have such an amazing spirit, that people feel ''so comfortable'' allowing you to capture them.<br/> <br/>You deserve this recognition.</td>', 'Congratulation beautiful one. You have such an amazing spirit, that people feel ''so comfortable'' allowing you to capture them. You deserve this recognition.', '2009-01-07 08:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177283, 751420, 97893, '<td valign="top">WoW!<br/> <br/>The picture is just fantastic. You could capture 3 elderly people<br/>in one shot and that too in such a moody, lovely composition.<br/>I also love the title, it compliments a wonderful street picture so well!<br/> <br/>Congrats on your 5th place!<br/> <br/>-Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'WoW! The picture is just fantastic. You could capture 3 elderly peoplein one shot and that too in such a moody, lovely composition.I also love the title, it compliments a wonderful street picture so well! Congrats on your 5th place! -Vikram ', '2009-01-07 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177288, 751291, 97893, '<td valign="top">So intimate, so wonderful! Frame it and post it on your wall! Do you know them? If they are your parents, you should feel proud of this picture! Lovely!<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'So intimate, so wonderful! Frame it and post it on your wall! Do you know them? If they are your parents, you should feel proud of this picture! Lovely! -Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:14:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177297, 750873, 97893, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge I rarely vote for the challenges that I participate, I just feel nervous about any bias on my side affecting my voting; I appreciate very much that you do). But, if I was to vote, it would be a 10 for me. It is complete for me. It is such a delightful capture. And lights and tones are just perfect.  I wish to take as good a picture of my mother as you did, soon. :-)<br/> <br/>Good Day Jason! Wonderful work!<br/> <br/>-Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge I rarely vote for the challenges that I participate, I just feel nervous about any bias on my side affecting my voting; I appreciate very much that you do). But, if I was to vote, it would be a 10 for me. It is complete for me. It is such a delightful capture. And lights and tones are just perfect.  I wish to take as good a picture of my mother as you did, soon. :-) Good Day Jason! Wonderful work! -Vikram ', '2009-01-07 08:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177299, 751334, 97893, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very very much for the mood, composition (innovative in that), and intent that it presents. Great!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram<br/> <br/>Just a small point: I wish it had a great DOF (but that is just me).</td>', 'I like this picture very very much for the mood, composition (innovative in that), and intent that it presents. Great! :-), Vikram Just a small point: I wish it had a great DOF (but that is just me).', '2009-01-07 08:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177300, 751437, 66494, '<td valign="top">Oh Sandy, <br/>What a fantastic shot. I''m so glad it was yours. Your inside beauty reflects our world''s outside beauty to perfection.<br/>Way to GO!!! Awesome and Congrats.</td>', 'Oh Sandy, What a fantastic shot. I''m so glad it was yours. Your inside beauty reflects our world''s outside beauty to perfection.Way to GO!!! Awesome and Congrats.', '2009-01-07 08:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177301, 751334, 97893, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very very much for the mood, composition (innovative in that), and intent that it presents. Great!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram<br/> <br/>Just a small point: I wish it had a  greater DOF (but that is just me).</td>', 'I like this picture very very much for the mood, composition (innovative in that), and intent that it presents. Great! :-), Vikram Just a small point: I wish it had a  greater DOF (but that is just me).', '2009-01-07 08:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177308, 751334, 11854, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Terry! Congrats on the top 10. And, no I wouldn''t tell her it was here either.</td>', 'Lovely shot Terry! Congrats on the top 10. And, no I wouldn''t tell her it was here either.', '2009-01-07 08:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177315, 751194, 97893, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture Nathan! Gives a feeling of closeness. I am wondering why he is looking down. It somehow, makes the portrait even better. Very well done!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Fantastic picture Nathan! Gives a feeling of closeness. I am wondering why he is looking down. It somehow, makes the portrait even better. Very well done! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177321, 750492, 97893, '<td valign="top">Very different, and personal take on the theme. Very nice picture Dennis. It is wonderful that you take very nice street-photos, with a personal touch.<br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/>-Vikram</td>', 'Very different, and personal take on the theme. Very nice picture Dennis. It is wonderful that you take very nice street-photos, with a personal touch. Congrats!-Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:36:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177329, 750455, 97893, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed picture! I like the poise of your GrandPa, and the b+w conversion is great!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Very nicely composed picture! I like the poise of your GrandPa, and the b+w conversion is great! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:38:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177336, 751285, 97893, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Composition!<br/>Graceful poise!<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'Fantastic Composition!Graceful poise! -Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177343, 751551, 97893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture; could have been only taken by a friend!<br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Beautiful picture; could have been only taken by a friend!:-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177348, 751415, 97893, '<td valign="top">What a  cheerful, wonderful outdoor portrait!<br/> <br/>Congrats on this capture Akbari!<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'What a  cheerful, wonderful outdoor portrait! Congrats on this capture Akbari! -Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177353, 751203, 97893, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! Priceless!<br/>What a flow of comfort and glee in this picture!<br/>So well done Ben!<br/> <br/>-Vikram<br/> <br/>p.s. Hey, you have started shooting again! :-).</td>', 'I love this picture! Priceless!What a flow of comfort and glee in this picture!So well done Ben! -Vikram p.s. Hey, you have started shooting again! :-).', '2009-01-07 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177356, 751437, 43774, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon Sandy, and what a beautiful, bittersweet story to go along with it.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon Sandy, and what a beautiful, bittersweet story to go along with it.', '2009-01-07 08:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177359, 751440, 42740, '<td valign="top">I love it - a very nice capture.</td>', 'I love it - a very nice capture.', '2009-01-07 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177363, 751554, 97893, '<td valign="top">Great picture/portrait!<br/> <br/>The expression just hits you straight, and the composition is simply wonderful! Very well done Julliane!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Great picture/portrait! The expression just hits you straight, and the composition is simply wonderful! Very well done Julliane! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177366, 751437, 51269, '<td valign="top">Sandy , you''ve gone &amp; done it again ! Congratulations-wonderful portrait &amp; story.</td>', 'Sandy , you''ve gone & done it again ! Congratulations-wonderful portrait & story.', '2009-01-07 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177367, 751336, 97893, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, every-which-way!<br/> <br/>My suggestion: Take a 12 inch plus, print and gift it to your friend. He/she would love it!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Excellent portrait, every-which-way! My suggestion: Take a 12 inch plus, print and gift it to your friend. He/she would love it! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177371, 751381, 97893, '<td valign="top">Very artistic shot! I love the composition, and feel!<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'Very artistic shot! I love the composition, and feel! -Vikram', '2009-01-07 08:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177379, 751347, 97893, '<td valign="top">Ah! What a feel in this picture! The pose, and composition is simply wonderful!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram<br/> <br/>p.s. I am wondering why you softened it. It does add the soft feel though, but perhaps a clear sharper picture would have worked even better. Just guessing!</td>', 'Ah! What a feel in this picture! The pose, and composition is simply wonderful! :-), Vikram p.s. I am wondering why you softened it. It does add the soft feel though, but perhaps a clear sharper picture would have worked even better. Just guessing!', '2009-01-07 08:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177388, 750145, 97893, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid. Melissa, it is so nice that you provided a description. I also like the fact that you take wonderful street pictures!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Very nice candid. Melissa, it is so nice that you provided a description. I also like the fact that you take wonderful street pictures! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177390, 749886, 97893, '<td valign="top">A wonderful way to take a portrait! Very environmental, and very personal feel! So nice!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'A wonderful way to take a portrait! Very environmental, and very personal feel! So nice! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:05:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177396, 750199, 97893, '<td valign="top">This picture is deceptive in thumb, but in full view it is just wonderful. If you want to play with this picture, I suggest the following. Do a dodge and burn on it. Burn all the back ground and go careful on face. I am sure this picture will just pop out!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'This picture is deceptive in thumb, but in full view it is just wonderful. If you want to play with this picture, I suggest the following. Do a dodge and burn on it. Burn all the back ground and go careful on face. I am sure this picture will just pop out! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177404, 751335, 97893, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!<br/>The tones and the details and poise are wonderful!<br/> <br/>Just a small nit-pick (a personal one on that): I feel, the shadow of glass on the face takes something away from his expression. <br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'Nice shot!The tones and the details and poise are wonderful! Just a small nit-pick (a personal one on that): I feel, the shadow of glass on the face takes something away from his expression.  :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177406, 750108, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow. I knew I wouldn''t go through this challenge, so thanks to Paul for guiding me here with his thumb.</td>', 'wow. I knew I wouldn''t go through this challenge, so thanks to Paul for guiding me here with his thumb.', '2009-01-07 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177409, 751437, 15711, '<td valign="top">Well look at you now.  This is really so well done Sandy.  You have the ability to have an immediate connection with every person you photograph.  Fabulous.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Well look at you now.  This is really so well done Sandy.  You have the ability to have an immediate connection with every person you photograph.  Fabulous.  Congratulations.', '2009-01-07 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177411, 750168, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  So well done.</td>', 'Congrats.  So well done.', '2009-01-07 09:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177415, 751440, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you and Sandy on the front page together.  Congrats, Enzo.  This is terrific.</td>', 'Nice to see you and Sandy on the front page together.  Congrats, Enzo.  This is terrific.', '2009-01-07 09:13:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177419, 750801, 97893, '<td valign="top">A perfect portrait for me!<br/> <br/>I like the angle, the composition, color, expression and just right DOF! Very well done!<br/> <br/>:-), Vikram</td>', 'A perfect portrait for me! I like the angle, the composition, color, expression and just right DOF! Very well done! :-), Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177445, 751527, 97893, '<td valign="top">This such a wonderfully done portrait! The presence is emphatic, the expression pleasing, the composition perfect, DOF just appropriate, color works so well.<br/> <br/>And so intimately taken, that it gives a warmth and one feels like hugging the model.<br/> <br/>A perfect 10 from me.<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'This such a wonderfully done portrait! The presence is emphatic, the expression pleasing, the composition perfect, DOF just appropriate, color works so well. And so intimately taken, that it gives a warmth and one feels like hugging the model. A perfect 10 from me. -Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177448, 751437, 44877, '<td valign="top">Sandy, this is completely outstanding! Many congratulations for your ribbon on this deeply moving photo. <br/> <br/>Your story is wonderful, as well!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sandy, this is completely outstanding! Many congratulations for your ribbon on this deeply moving photo.  Your story is wonderful, as well!! ', '2009-01-07 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177455, 749962, 97893, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet picture and such an intimate expression!<br/>Compositionally and technically fantastic!<br/> <br/>Very well done! Should have scored far better IMHO!<br/> <br/>-Vikram</td>', 'Such a sweet picture and such an intimate expression!Compositionally and technically fantastic! Very well done! Should have scored far better IMHO! -Vikram', '2009-01-07 09:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177491, 750105, 2764, '<td valign="top">This could have been a winner - the yellow white balance probably cost you a lot of points.</td>', 'This could have been a winner - the yellow white balance probably cost you a lot of points.', '2009-01-07 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177503, 751437, 67697, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy!!!!  I knew I could come here and see another wonderful story to go with the photo.  Your ability to meet complete strangers and pull out this artistry is such a gift.  I hope that you are able to find him again and maybe even give him a framed pic. Then he can set it out as a little marquee for himself.  Yay for the blue!!!!</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy!!!!  I knew I could come here and see another wonderful story to go with the photo.  Your ability to meet complete strangers and pull out this artistry is such a gift.  I hope that you are able to find him again and maybe even give him a framed pic. Then he can set it out as a little marquee for himself.  Yay for the blue!!!!', '2009-01-07 09:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177537, 751437, 49652, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo, Sandy!  This is awesomely awesome.  Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Woo hoo, Sandy!  This is awesomely awesome.  Congrats on the blue.', '2009-01-07 09:52:34.000000', NULL, 0);
