(5178273, 749886, 62281, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.<br/> <br/>I don''t really have anyone old to take a portrait of at the moment, and I came up with this after visiting the cemetery on Christmas day, while looking for something different for a Christmas photo.<br/> <br/>jjstager2 your spot on with the comment about moving to get more of her legs.<br/> <br/>Anyway very pleased with 17 for a portrait with no face.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone. I don''t really have anyone old to take a portrait of at the moment, and I came up with this after visiting the cemetery on Christmas day, while looking for something different for a Christmas photo. jjstager2 your spot on with the comment about moving to get more of her legs. Anyway very pleased with 17 for a portrait with no face.', '2009-01-07 15:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
