(5181860, 751440, 34938, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jdroullard:</b></div><hr/><i> This was my fav, I gave you a 10, so in return I''d like you to tell this yankee what "chuffed" means...  Sounds like something you need ointment for! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL Josh!<br/> <br/>Chuffed means something like happy, proud, with a big smirk on your face. We also say ''tickled pink''. <br/> <br/>Not sure that translates, but you get the picture,<br/> <br/>Enzo<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Jdroullard: This was my fav, I gave you a 10, so in return I''d like you to tell this yankee what "chuffed" means...  Sounds like something you need ointment for!   LOL Josh! Chuffed means something like happy, proud, with a big smirk on your face. We also say ''tickled pink''.  Not sure that translates, but you get the picture, Enzo', '2009-01-09 08:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
