(5188854, 751285, 88523, '<td valign="top">He rocks and so does his picture... Would like to know more about him...</td>', 'He rocks and so does his picture... Would like to know more about him...', '2009-01-13 09:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5189000, 751440, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>81???  No freakin'' way?  When I voted on this, I even almost made the comment that he didn''t look elderly enough to be in this challenge!!  Maybe you should''ve emphasized his few wrinkles or something.  hahah.  oh wait, this was basic.  no, maybe you shouldn''t have.  :P<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I like this crop.  It shows enough of his face to really show the subject, but only show part of it seems to say that while we can see part of him, the photograph can''t tell EVERYTHING about him.  <br/> <br/>Technically, you have nailed everything -- from focus and exposure to the bw conversion.<br/> <br/>Also, while I don''t know your father, it almost looks like his face and mouth are "stern" but his eyes are "smiling."<br/> <br/>Great shot, and deserving of a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Karma<br/></td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat 81???  No freakin'' way?  When I voted on this, I even almost made the comment that he didn''t look elderly enough to be in this challenge!!  Maybe you should''ve emphasized his few wrinkles or something.  hahah.  oh wait, this was basic.  no, maybe you shouldn''t have.  :P Compositionally, I like this crop.  It shows enough of his face to really show the subject, but only show part of it seems to say that while we can see part of him, the photograph can''t tell EVERYTHING about him.   Technically, you have nailed everything -- from focus and exposure to the bw conversion. Also, while I don''t know your father, it almost looks like his face and mouth are "stern" but his eyes are "smiling." Great shot, and deserving of a ribbon. Karma', '2009-01-13 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5189001, 750106, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>Compositionally, this shot is done well, I think.  It is fairly balanced between the face and background, but may need just a smidgen more at the bottom -- maybe include more of the chin.  <br/> <br/>Technically, the first thing that strikes me is that it is out of focus.  However, upon second glance, I can see that the glasses do indeed seem focused.  However, since the face takes up more of the frame, and is the primary "focus" (no pun intended), the overall impression that one takes away from the shot is that it is soft.  <br/> <br/>More than that, though, her face color is very similar to to the background color in the upper third.  This gives a very subtle impression of a lack of contrast.  I''m wondering if a bw conversion would have helped this, or if having more contrast in the color version could have minimized it.<br/> <br/>Overall a shot to be treasured for years.  Nice work.<br/> <br/>Karma</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat Compositionally, this shot is done well, I think.  It is fairly balanced between the face and background, but may need just a smidgen more at the bottom -- maybe include more of the chin.   Technically, the first thing that strikes me is that it is out of focus.  However, upon second glance, I can see that the glasses do indeed seem focused.  However, since the face takes up more of the frame, and is the primary "focus" (no pun intended), the overall impression that one takes away from the shot is that it is soft.   More than that, though, her face color is very similar to to the background color in the upper third.  This gives a very subtle impression of a lack of contrast.  I''m wondering if a bw conversion would have helped this, or if having more contrast in the color version could have minimized it. Overall a shot to be treasured for years.  Nice work. Karma', '2009-01-13 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5197497, 750873, 28742, '<td valign="top"><b>My 10,000th comment:</b> <br/>I gave this a 7 in voting. Had I known it was yours, I''d have given it a 7. :) Please accept my belated congrats on your new PB and a fantastic portrait of your beautiful mother.</td>', 'My 10,000th comment: I gave this a 7 in voting. Had I known it was yours, I''d have given it a 7. :) Please accept my belated congrats on your new PB and a fantastic portrait of your beautiful mother.', '2009-01-16 23:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
