(5227821, 750108, 68504, '<td valign="top">A list of the contributing elements would not do it justice, although the bright light on the crowning white hair and the centering of the crown do seem to focus the vortex of details, but this is an after the fact observation; <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a>''s essay celebrates the essence of this beautifully plangent portrait.</td>', 'A list of the contributing elements would not do it justice, although the bright light on the crowning white hair and the centering of the crown do seem to focus the vortex of details, but this is an after the fact observation;  ubique''s essay celebrates the essence of this beautifully plangent portrait.', '2009-01-30 17:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
