(5228128, 750108, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> ... vortex of details ... this beautifully plangent portrait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh God, this photograph is just getting better and better as it is <i>itself</i> aging!  I am thrilled that so many have been moved to think and write with such feeling about this extraordinary photograph.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: ... vortex of details ... this beautifully plangent portrait.  Oh God, this photograph is just getting better and better as it is itself aging!  I am thrilled that so many have been moved to think and write with such feeling about this extraordinary photograph.', '2009-01-30 21:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262525, 751437, 103926, '<td valign="top">Sandy, you truly have a gift when it comes to this type of photography; part of what makes these shots so successful is the fact that the subjects are obvously very comfortable with you, fully trusting, etc., and that is reflected in the image.  Wonderful display of character in this amazing story telling shot; love the tones; outstanding!  Nina</td>', 'Sandy, you truly have a gift when it comes to this type of photography; part of what makes these shots so successful is the fact that the subjects are obvously very comfortable with you, fully trusting, etc., and that is reflected in the image.  Wonderful display of character in this amazing story telling shot; love the tones; outstanding!  Nina', '2009-02-18 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5394763, 751440, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot. I''d love to organize a collection of B&amp;W father shots. See comments in this image...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748404" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a wonderful shot. I''d love to organize a collection of B&W father shots. See comments in this image...', '2009-03-21 23:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5513747, 750532, 12611, '<td valign="top">Generally, the focus of a shot; the point of interest  or perhaps the "place where the viewers eye is drawn to" of a shot consists of , the place where the lightest value and darkest values in the photo meet, where the biggest contrast in color, either in hue or color temp. That being said, the viewers eye goes right to the hearing aid, and teh angle of the shot is way to harsh with a death stare out the window. Otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'Generally, the focus of a shot; the point of interest  or perhaps the "place where the viewers eye is drawn to" of a shot consists of , the place where the lightest value and darkest values in the photo meet, where the biggest contrast in color, either in hue or color temp. That being said, the viewers eye goes right to the hearing aid, and teh angle of the shot is way to harsh with a death stare out the window. Otherwise, nice shot.', '2009-06-04 10:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
